msgctxt "80"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "What happened? Was I right? Was I being stalked?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Yeah, I found a guy who sure seemed like he fit the bill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Really!? I knew it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "But don't worry about it. I had a talk with him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Oh, you did...? Thank you very..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr "Mmh?"

msgctxt "164"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr "Che succede?"

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Oh no, it's just... I still feel like someone's watching\r\n"
"me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"But it's okay! I'm sure it's just my imagination running wild! Thank you so "
"much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Here, for your trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "You got <Color:8>10,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>10.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"(Can't help but still feel worried about her, but what else\r\n"
"can I do? I didn't find anyone who fit the bill.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Hi, Kiryu-san! Is everything all right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"I was following a suspicious-looking guy, but\r\n"
"I lost him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Oh, you did...? Don't worry about it, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"Maybe I'm just imagining this whole \"stalker\" thing... and\r\n"
"I wouldn't want to waste any more of your time, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Here, for your trouble. Thank you so much!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "You got <Color:8>10,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>10.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"(I'm still a little worried about her, but if\r\n"
"she says she's okay, I'll leave it at that.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

